    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The increasing incidence of Parkinson's disease in developing countries must be countered by regular exercise, said experts. This discussion was held at an awareness session on World Parkinson's Day hosted by the Aga Khan University Hospital in association with Pakistan Parkinson's Society today.",
